; OWNd-built frames vs the Encyclopedia forms (test2 report 21, "OWNd master
; vs the OpenWebNet Encyclopedia", 2026-10-28). Every pair below is one row of
; that report: the frame OWNd's builder emits next to the form the
; Encyclopedia functional pages define. The question for each gateway: does
; the daemon treat the two forms alike (same reply, same verdict, same bus
; bytes) or does it refuse / re-address the OWNd form? Unordered, one step
; per frame, no WHO 4 DIMENSION 22 frame anywhere in this suite.
